L.append(ev("2022-05-03","Janine Hall (Support Coordinator, FFG)","At 10:11 AM Janine emailed CFO Rejaul Alam querying why a single FFG Support Coordination invoice of $2,027.84 had been paid from participant Marisha Lombard's plan (balance reduced to $393.87 from about $3,097.71; plan expired 7/4/22 and was rolled over pending home-modification documents) when she had provided no such work. At 10:12 AM she forwarded the thread to her personal Gmail address janinehall09@gmail.com.","internal email + forward to personal webmail","query on funds depletion; copy retained outside FFG","communication","fact","T9.14 pp.286-287 (idx 295-296)",["Janine Hall","Rejaul Alam","Marisha Lombard"],
 notes="backstory_link: first of several FFG emails Janine forwarded to her personal Gmail (3 May, 13 Jun, 20 Jun, then 1 Jul, 13-14 Jul 2022 forwards to 'Janine Hall') while employed and before supplying them to the Commission on 18 Jul 2022. Content of the email is a query, not itself an accusation."))
L.append(ev("2022-06-13","Lea Warner (Provider Choice plan manager); Tanya Gukwa; Janine Hall; Rejaul Alam","Provider Choice query about FFG invoice INV-1161 ($10,006.81, raised via Xero by Rejaul Alam on 7 Jun 2022 16:35, due 13 Jun) for participant Kara Negus: Lea Warner emailed Tanya Gukwa 10:29 AM; Tanya forwarded to Danica H (cc Janine H, Jan Nuttal) 10:54 AM saying the invoices would 'slash Kara's core funding in half' and Kara says services worth $10,000 were not delivered; Janine (12:30 PM) forwarded to Rejaul Alam (cc Tanya, Danica, Jan Nuttal) confirming invoice NDIS-1768-1 was correct but saying she, as previous Support Coordinator, had not provided services of that value, and asked him to check; Janine forwarded this to her Gmail at 12:40 PM.","email chain","plan manager and participant disputed invoice","communication","fact","T9.15 pp.293-297 (idx 302-306)",["Lea Warner","Tanya Gukwa","Danica Hall","Janine Hall","Jan Nuttall","Rejaul Alam","Kara Negus"],
 notes="backstory_link: Jan Nuttal (Operations Manager at this time) copied on invoice-dispute emails on 13 Jun 2022; Janine forwards to personal Gmail 12:40 PM same day."))
L.append(ev("2022-06-20","Richard Paul (Provider Choice plan manager); Janine Hall","Richard Paul emailed Janine Hall after a phone call raising plan-manager query on invoices for participant Charlie Harrison, singling out invoice 1231; Janine forwarded to janinehall09@gmail.com at 4:15 PM (Mon 20 Jun 2022).","email + forward to personal Gmail","invoice query","communication","fact","T9.15 pp.311-313 (idx 320-322)",["Richard Paul","Janine Hall","Charlie Harrison"],
 notes="backstory_link: Janine's forwarding to personal Gmail. Also T9.15 contains plan-manager invoice listings (Self-Management Capacity Building / Plan and Financial Management items at 0.25-4.00 hrs) pp.319-323 - not summarised."))
L.append(ev("2022-03-31","Vida Reid; Modplex Construction accounts (Tarilee/Tari Lee); Honey Nguyen; Janine H (cc)","Vida Reid emailed Modplex accounts (cc Honey Nguyen, Janine H, Francesco) re participant Angela Cutler's bathroom-modification quote: 'This quote is okay to be provided with a break down to Angela if asked but things like council permit please don't quote on there because then NDIS will not pay for it. Just give a quote of total cost for modification without break down to NDIS ... don't quote building license and permits'. Modplex had on 22 Mar 2022 (quote PP220321) and 31 Mar 2022 asked for approval before sending quote to Cutler.","email","instruction on how quote should be presented to NDIA (as written by Vida)","communication","fact","T9.16 pp.324-327 (idx 333-336)",["Vida Reid","Honey Nguyen","Janine Hall","Francesco","Angela Cutler","Tarilee"],
 notes="Wording is Vida's own. Janine H is on cc, i.e. Janine saw this email on 31 Mar 2022 - the day after her 30 Mar fraud report. Janine forwarded the chain on 14 Jul 2022 (11:22 AM) to 'Janine Hall'. Characterisation as concealment is an allegation; Vida's explanation is not in the tender."))
L.append(ev("2022-03-10","Melissa Byfield (LAC, APM - NDIS partner); Vida Reid","Chain between Byfield (Local Area Coordination, APM) and Vida Reid on 1, 2 and 10 Mar 2022 about overdue home-modification quotes for Angela Cutler's plan review (meeting 22 Feb 2022). Vida said builder 'Frank' was ill/rescheduling; on 10 Mar 2022 10:06 PM Vida said builder would first provide a project management and drawings quote ($18,000, later invoice ND220404 paid) and the home-mod costs after assessments. On 12 Jul 2022 Modplex quote PP220712 ($78,000 + GST = $85,800 ensuite renovation) addressed to NDIS, with credit for $18,000 paid on invoice ND220404.","email chain; quotation","plan progression","communication","fact","T9.16 pp.328-343 and 335 (idx 337-345)",["Melissa Byfield","Vida Reid","Angela Cutler","Alex Bowers","Francesco"],
 notes="Context chain; the T9.16 package also includes Tradelink and Stonehenge Ceramics quotes dated 1 Jul 2022 for Cutler. Janine forwarded on 14 Jul 2022 11:22 AM to herself."))
L.append(ev("2022-06-23","Ousman Kamara (Teams Coordinator, Hybrid Hive); Rejaul Alam; Vida Reid","Ousman Kamara emailed Sarah King (Hive) 4:14 PM, cc Rejaul Alam, Simon Reid, Vida Reid, Isabella Wise, Tammy Doidge, subject 'Immediate effect': he had just been advised by Rejaul that 'we are stopping every support for Megan Goodwin in Safety Bay with immediate effect' and asked for every shift to be cancelled as of today.","email","instruction relayed from CFO","communication","fact","T9.16 p.343 (idx 352)",["Ousman Kamara","Sarah King","Rejaul Alam","Simon Reid","Vida Reid","Isabella Wise","Tammy Doidge","Meghan Goodwin"],
 notes="Simon Reid appears on cc. Janine's 27 Jun email says Sarah King phoned her late Thu 23 Jun asking for clarification. 'Megan'/'Meghan' Goodwin spelled both ways."))
L.append(ev("2022-06-27","Janine Hall; Jan Nuttal; Rejaul Alam; Vida Reid","27 Jun 2022 email chain about Meghan Goodwin's supports being stopped: Janine to Jan Nuttal 2:43 PM (Sarah called late Thursday asking about the 23 Jun instruction; Ozzy referred her to RJ; RJ said it was Vida's instruction; Meghan not told); Jan to Rejaul 2:52 PM confused; Rejaul 3:06 PM: 'The supports were stopped on The Agency's direction', passed to Ozzy the previous week when Vida advised him; Jan 3:32 PM to Vida confused as plan only 2 months old and 'we have submitted an s100' [OCR: '$100']; Vida 4:08 PM: 'They told me it needs to stop! They said she cannot have this much supports' and 'a $100 [s100] must go in and until that time there has been over utilisation so it must stop for now'.","email chain","explaining a stop to supports said to be on NDIA direction","communication","fact","T9.16 pp.341-343 (idx 350-352)",["Janine Hall","Jan Nuttall","Rejaul Alam","Vida Reid","Ousman Kamara","Sarah King","Meghan Goodwin"],
 notes="Vida/Rejaul attribute the stop to NDIA's direction; compare with Janine's allegation that FFG over-charged Meghan. Whether NDIA directed this is not shown in the tender. OCR renders 's100' as '$100'. backstory_link: Jan Nuttal active at ffg.net.au on 27 Jun 2022 but described by Vida on 1 Jul 2022 as 'previous Operations Manager'. Janine sat between Jan and Vida in this chain."))
L.append(ev("2022-07-01","Vida Reid; Tanya Gukwa; Leigh M; Janine H (cc)","Tanya Gukwa (Support Coordinator/Recovery Coach) emailed resignation letter to Vida (cc Jess Goile, Janine H) at 8:44 AM on 1 Jul 2022 citing 'honesty, integrity, and structure'; one week's notice 'till the 8th of June [sic]'. At 3:08 PM Vida wrote to Leigh M, cc Janine H: 'She stated Jan has affected her. I know Jan has been messaging people and staff trying to get them to quit'; Honey (Nguyen) was messaged and told sender to send communication to HR. Janine Hall forwarded the thread to herself at 3:09 PM.","email","internal response to resignation","communication","fact","T9.16 pp.417-419 (idx 426-428)",["Tanya Gukwa","Vida Reid","Leigh M","Jess Goile","Janine Hall","Jan Nuttall","Honey Nguyen"],
 notes="backstory_link (HIGH): Vida's contemporaneous 1 Jul 2022 statement that Jan (Nuttall) was messaging staff to get them to quit - supports Simon's position that ex-staff were recruiting resignations/complaints. Janine Hall (cc) saw it. Tanya Gukwa then appears as Janine's colleague and co-author? (check Tanya complaint). Resignation date text says 8 June though email is 1 July - drafting error or template."))
L.append(ev("2022-07-01","Vida Reid; Sarah-Jane Clulow; Tammy Mogg; Baldivis Pharmacy (Kate)","1 Jul 2022 emails about participant Sarah-Jane Clulow: pharmacy statement 1:17 PM; Vida 2:41 PM tells pharmacy FFG will no longer pay invoices as 'she has terminated her contract'; Clulow 4:00 PM says agreement runs to 22/7/22 and correspondence must go via Tammy Mogg; Vida 6:46 PM and again says 7 invoices owed, was 'advised by Jan that Sarah has requested immediate termination' and that a paid support cannot be next of kin ('red flag under the NDIS guidelines'); Mogg 8:15 PM cites 4-week termination notice. Janine forwarded to herself 13 Jul 2022 4:28 PM.","email chain","dispute over termination and unpaid invoices","communication","fact","T9.17 pp.374-379 (idx 383-388)",["Vida Reid","Sarah-Jane Clulow","Tammy Mogg","Kate (Baldivis Pharmacy)","Jan Nuttall","Janine Hall"],
 notes="Vida says 'Jan previous Operations Manager at our company had a meeting' with Clulow and Mogg - meaning Jan Nuttall had left FFG by 1 Jul 2022. backstory_link: Clulow lodged complaint with Commission 6 Jul 2022 (T9.21) five days after this exchange; Jan Nuttall is the NDIA-chain complainant (T9.22) 11 Aug 2022. Vida states the 'agency' advised on next-of-kin - not corroborated in tender."))
L.append(ev("2022-07-05","Tori Fitton (FFG); Khaiah Thomson and Lenni Duffield (Huntington's WA); Danica H (cc)","1-12 Jul 2022 email trail re participant Suzanne Shepard: Tori Fitton (1 Jul 2:11 PM, cc Danica H) says unpaid cleaning and Board and Lodging invoices may go to debt collector; Thomson (5 Jul) says no signed cleaning contract and an independent advocate is being considered; Tori (5 Jul) offers meeting, sends breakdown. Thomson forwarded trail to Lenni Duffield 12 Jul 8:54 AM; Duffield emailed Janine Hall on 13 Jul 2022 after phone call criticising cleaning billed 9 hrs/week (incl. 25 Dec 2021, 28 Dec 2021, 1 Jan 2022 public holidays) plus travel and km, no service agreement, no complaints policy on website, asked whether cleaning continued after invoice rejection. Janine forwarded to herself 13 Jul 2022 4:31 PM. Accommodation agreement (12 Nov 2021, commencing 17/11/2021, $130.49/night B&L) included.","email chain; agreement","complaint-style inquiry from support coordinator organisation","communication","fact","T9.17 pp.380-419 (idx 389-424)",["Tori Fitton","Khaiah Thomson","Lenni Duffield","Danica Hall","Janine Hall","Suzanne Shepard","Vida Reid"],
 notes="Participant health references omitted. Danica H on cc 1 and 5 Jul 2022. Janine Hall receiving Huntington's WA email 13 Jul 2022 as Service Manager."))
L.append(ev("2022-07-01","Assist Plan Managers (Paddy, Edilyn); Tanya Gukwa; Janine H; Danica Hall","Assist Plan Managers (1 Jul 2022 6:56 AM) could not process FFG invoice NDIS-1919-1 for $225.33 (issued via Xero 'on behalf of Danica Hall' 30 Jun 2022 15:48) because participant Eve Adam's Coordination of Supports balance was $16.38 (started $2,842.11); Paddy 9:53 AM sent invoice screenshots to Tanya Gukwa and Janine; Tanya 9:16 AM said she forwarded query to management as 'our system is not reflective of the remaining amounts'. Janine forwarded to herself at 10:05 AM.","email chain","plan manager query on depleted funds","communication","fact","T9.16 pp.354-360 (idx 363-369)",["Assist Plan Managers","Paddy","Edilyn","Tanya Gukwa","Janine Hall","Danica Hall","Eve Adam"],
 notes="Danica Hall's name appears as the Xero sender on FFG invoice on 30 Jun 2022, the day before her scheduled departure? (her statement says resignation 19 Jul 2022 per T9.4). Eve Adam: 'Assist' = Assist Plan Managers (not NurseAssist)."))
